{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And he went up onto the mountain.</b> The meaning: to the top of the mountain, for there the Glory was." "<b>And Moses was on the mountain.</b> That he did not descend. And it is written concerning these forty days: \"Bread I did not eat and water I did not drink\" (Deuteronomy 9:9). And this is a great wonder; none like it happened before him."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:38:09.478211396Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}